                      "fill": "$ink-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Most SaaS products don't fail because the product is bad — they fail because nobody knows they exist. As a solo founder, you're responsible for building AND distributing your product.",
