                      "fill": "$ink-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Distribution OS turns the vague goal of \"grow my product\" into a concrete, weekly checklist of high-impact actions — personalized to where your product is right now.",
